sform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;◆&lt;/span&gt; Key Features&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;color: #4a5568; font-size: 12px; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Zero Version Lock-in:&lt;/b&gt; Relies exclusively on public OpenIDE APIs. Survives NetBeans upgrades without breakage.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Dynamic Catalog Routing:&lt;/b&gt; Automatically resolves the exact update catalog for your active NetBeans major release.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;1-Click Installation:&lt;/b&gt; Seamlessly downloads, validates, and installs Anahata ASI Studio from within the IDE.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;JavaFX Activation:&lt;/b&gt; Verifies host JDK JavaFX runtime support and activates the NetBeans JavaFX kit when needed.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legacy Center Cleanup:&lt;/b&gt; Detects and removes obsolete update centers from previous NetBeans versions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr style=&quot;border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; margin: 20px 0;&quot;/&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center; font-style: italic; color: #555; font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;Developed with pride and passion by Anahata. Força Barça! &lt;span style=&quot;color: #004d98;&quot;&gt;●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #a50044;&quot;&gt;●&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" OpenIDE-Module-Module-Dependencies="org.netbeans.api.annotations.common/1 &gt; 1.60, org.netbeans.api.progress/1 &gt; 1.80, org.netbeans.modules.autoupdate.services &gt; 1.88, org.netbeans.modules.autoupdate.ui &gt; 1.78, org.openide.awt &gt; 7.100, org.openide.dialogs &gt; 7.79, org.openide.modules &gt; 7.80, org.openide.util &gt; 9.40, org.openide.util.lookup &gt; 8.66, org.openide.util.ui &gt; 9.41, org.openide.windows &gt; 6.109" OpenIDE-Module-Name="Anahata ASI Update Center - NetBeans" OpenIDE-Module-Requires="org.openide.modules.ModuleFormat1" OpenIDE-Module-Short-Description="Standalone Update Center and Installer 